+/// Item-5 lever (ML-aspiration tier 3, delta-baseline): the first-try
+/// aspiration half-width scales with recent score volatility
+/// |score(d-1) - score(d-2)|: `half = clamp(K * |delta|, MIN, MAX)`. K=2
+/// centers the window at the proven fixed `ASPIRATION_HALF_WIDTH` (=50) for the
+/// median ID score-delta (~25 cp), narrowing for stable nodes and widening for
+/// volatile ones. Falls back to `ASPIRATION_HALF_WIDTH` when score(d-2) is
+/// unavailable (the first aspiration-eligible iteration, or after an abort).
+const ASPIRATION_DELTA_K: i32 = 2;
+const ASPIRATION_DELTA_MIN: i32 = 25;
+const ASPIRATION_DELTA_MAX: i32 = 250;
